    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35609" root="قسب" body-key="q">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَسَبَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَسِبَ</span></b> , <i>It</i> (water) <i>ran,</i> or <i>flowed:</i> (S,
O, K:) or <i>it ran,</i> or <i>flowed, with a sound,
beneath trees</i> or <i>leaves.</i> (So accord. to different
copies of the A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَسَبَتِ الشَّمْسُ</span> <i>The sun
began to set.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَسُبٌ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَسُبَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُسُوبَةٌ</span>
(A, O, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُسُوبٌ</span>, (K,) <i>It was,</i> or <i>became,
hard:</i> (O, K:) or <i>hard, and dry,</i> or <i>tough:</i> you
say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَسُبَ التَّمْرُ</span> <i>The dates were,</i> or <i>became, hard,
and dry,</i> or <i>tough.</i> (A, TA.)

